<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
<Document>
<name>Goa KTCL Major Bus Stands - BusMitra Seed</name>
<description><![CDATA[
14 researched KTCL bus-stand locations for the BusMitra prototype.
This is a major-bus-stand seed, not the complete Goa stop network.
The official KTCL GTFS feed is the source to use for the complete
stop and route dataset.
]]></description>
